                        ],
                        "form": "сверхдержа́ве"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "ea65afb7-6ab2-46f2-b412-c3bd2fe41ac9",
                        "entry_id": "9cb1db4d-ccaf-3c41-9e6e-ce93c1a4bb36",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "сверхдержа́вах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6829d470-0ddf-3494-a14e-e3af36c17b6a",
                        "entry_id": "9cb1db4d-ccaf-3c41-9e6e-ce93c1a4bb36",
                        "glosses": [
                            "полит. государство, обладающее подавляющим военным, политическим, экономическим и иным превосходством над большинством других государств"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "26e9dd59-bbe5-409f-afbe-1eab88ea8e68",
                                "sense_id": "6829d470-0ddf-3494-a14e-e3af36c17b6a",
                                "text": "Соединённые Штаты Америки, считая себя единственной сверхдержавой и располагая во всех основных регионах мира мощными группировками вооружённых сил, в 2002 году поделили всю планету, включая территорию России и Антарктиды, на зоны оперативной ответственности своих объединённых командований."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d5ee9d63-522c-3ea3-925b-ce3b0249cc5a",
                        "entry_id": "9cb1db4d-ccaf-3c41-9e6e-ce93c1a4bb36",
                        "glosses": [
                            "страна, обладающая подавляющим превосходством над большинством других стран в какой-либо отдельной области, обозначенной в определении"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "(с согласованным определением)"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4d522cb3-5d24-453a-b860-4b3f49ad293f",
                                "sense_id": "d5ee9d63-522c-3ea3-925b-ce3b0249cc5a",
                                "text": "Футбольная сверхдержава."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0702e11f-20dd-4715-91c5-02fd7aa1c9d6",
                                "sense_id": "d5ee9d63-522c-3ea3-925b-ce3b0249cc5a",
                                "text": "Энергетическая сверхдержава."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "83e21eb4-052d-4ead-8e9e-49ec10ed84f8",
                                "sense_id": "d5ee9d63-522c-3ea3-925b-ce3b0249cc5a",
                                "text": "Благодаря независимости, которую Путин обеспечил России, благодаря её новой роли энергетической сверхдержавы, команда нынешнего президента излучает такую уверенность, какой никогда не отличались ни Брежнев, последний традиционный советский лидер, ни его более демократичные преемники Горбачёв и Ельцин."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9959a729-e20f-4c1d-b2c7-e29cea60e977",
                        "source_entry_id": "9cb1db4d-ccaf-3c41-9e6e-ce93c1a4bb36",
                        "target_lang_word": "superpower",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "superpower",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a6ac94ec-3f1c-3815-b9ed-f8987cfe1848",
                                        "entry_id": "37b8deaa-e2bb-392c-a637-5051e0c533ec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sovereign state with dominant status on the globe and a very advanced military, especially the United States or formerly the Soviet Union."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e79edbdb-6e9e-4208-9b29-db764021f12a",
                                                "sense_id": "a6ac94ec-3f1c-3815-b9ed-f8987cfe1848",
                                                "text": "Our superpower competition will be reunified Germany (perhaps together with its European satellites) and expanding Japan (perhaps allied with China, if they can bring that off)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "84acfb17-fe4d-4672-a58d-bfdd3c6b5b0f",
                                                "sense_id": "a6ac94ec-3f1c-3815-b9ed-f8987cfe1848",
                                                "text": "The year 1945 marked the end of Europe's global hegemony and confirmed the US and the Soviet Union as global superpowers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d373b6d7-cc55-4726-9bde-332941365cdf",
                                                "sense_id": "a6ac94ec-3f1c-3815-b9ed-f8987cfe1848",
                                                "text": "Deals unveiled during US President Donald Trump's recent visit to the region showcased Saudi Arabia and the United Arab Emirates' aspirations to become AI superpowers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ff9bed0d-3c5b-3853-80f3-18dae481bdb6",
                                        "entry_id": "37b8deaa-e2bb-392c-a637-5051e0c533ec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An extraordinary physical or mental ability, especially possessed by a superhero or supervillain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe845cfc-f09a-4650-88ea-42bcfca1b97b",
                                                "sense_id": "ff9bed0d-3c5b-3853-80f3-18dae481bdb6",
                                                "text": "Trump’s superpower at home has long been to command intense loyalty from fellow Republicans."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c38ed7a2-e54d-4fe8-b894-cc148fa598c0",
                                                "sense_id": "ff9bed0d-3c5b-3853-80f3-18dae481bdb6",
                                                "text": "Administered in such a way, in that superpowers it assures."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e03cd5d-ed86-40da-b819-fadcb5749ccc",
                                                "sense_id": "ff9bed0d-3c5b-3853-80f3-18dae481bdb6",
                                                "text": "This is his superpower, I think. The comic geek always has one, and Oliver's is a poker face that would leave even the Holy Trinity guessing what he's thinking."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "198a443d-fc84-42a7-92b4-04393f0890b6",
                                                "sense_id": "ff9bed0d-3c5b-3853-80f3-18dae481bdb6",
                                                "text": "If I could have a superpower id^([sic]) want to be able to teleport. I hate walking and driving gives me headaches."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b184c9bc-be48-4bd3-8989-4fdc512ccde6",
                                                "sense_id": "ff9bed0d-3c5b-3853-80f3-18dae481bdb6",
                                                "text": "This is an incredible superpower on demand that would have been unimaginable at any previous time in history."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7136ec9b-2ae0-3601-80dc-ca1d3aa76044",
                                        "entry_id": "37b8deaa-e2bb-392c-a637-5051e0c533ec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Electricity generated in a large plant that is tied into a regional network, on a larger scale than was common in the early years of commercial electricity production."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "36041b44-b920-37bc-87b7-69b43b570f5d",
                                        "entry_id": "37b8deaa-e2bb-392c-a637-5051e0c533ec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A tetration."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fd9be53d-a0f0-35e5-99c7-9f503d63393a",
                                        "entry_id": "37b8deaa-e2bb-392c-a637-5051e0c533ec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Excessive or superior power."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "superpower",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "53ae512f-0a7f-3773-bc11-c46bc1bad80d",
                                        "entry_id": "94748aa1-1866-3fa2-bfd3-c0aa1f133045",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To give extraordinary powers to."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c068f59f-c162-4e57-b3b8-575d15596364",
                        "source_entry_id": "9cb1db4d-ccaf-3c41-9e6e-ce93c1a4bb36",
                        "target_lang_word": "Supermacht",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Supermacht",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0476ef8a-cbea-3f38-8bcf-0299bdd1ad48",
                                        "entry_id": "98132006-ca39-3c97-b9a7-a792ba7f601b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "„Staat, der globale Entwicklungen aufgrund seiner überragenden Fähigkeiten und Potentiale beeinflussen und bestimmen kann.“"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2a59769-8de0-4287-aee5-683733cd91b9",
                                                "sense_id": "0476ef8a-cbea-3f38-8bcf-0299bdd1ad48",
                                                "text": "Die Supermacht kontrollierte das Weltgeschehen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ee7e7ce-6ceb-4be8-8b87-b1dc36070693",
                                                "sense_id": "0476ef8a-cbea-3f38-8bcf-0299bdd1ad48",
                                                "text": "„Politisch werden die meisten Regierenden von den Supermächten umworben, auch finanziell.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cfc12595-a781-4eed-869e-2972608ceb60",
                                                "sense_id": "0476ef8a-cbea-3f38-8bcf-0299bdd1ad48",
                                                "text": "„An der Grenze am Ussuri kam es zu kriegerischen Auseinandersetzungen zwischen den roten Supermächten.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1aeabff-c67b-458f-ac15-f74e2d4f6e05",
                                                "sense_id": "0476ef8a-cbea-3f38-8bcf-0299bdd1ad48",
                                                "text": "„Das Klima zwichen den beiden Supermächten vereiste, ein alles vernichtender Atomkrieg rückte in den Bereich des Möglichen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "994bead2-67a7-49a7-a268-ee2eb24b06e2",
                                                "sense_id": "0476ef8a-cbea-3f38-8bcf-0299bdd1ad48",
                                                "text": "„Alles, was Amerika als Supermacht, als Weltpolizei, als mächtige Wirtschaftskraft, als verhasste und geliebte Idee, als Standard, an dem man sich misst und reibt, gegen den man anrennt, in den letzten 70 Jahren hinter sich gebracht hat, steht Deutschland ab jetzt in Europa bevor.“"
